E SHALL NOT REMAIN RESPONSIBLE FOR CONCRETE MIX, QUALITY, SHUTTERING , CURING, CONSTRUCTION MATERIAL, WORKMANSHIP, FAULTY CONSTRUCTION PROCEDURE, SAFETY OF ADJOINING STRUCTURES, SAFETY OF LABORS OR ANY ACCIDENT.  \P3. SAFE BEARING CAPACITY OF SOIL=3
  3
00kN/sqm.\P4. CONCRETE GRADE= M25 \P5. REINFORCEMENT=Fe500\P6. # DENOTES H.Y.S. STEEL CONFORMING I. S.1786\P7. LIVE LOAD ASSUMED= 2 KN/SQM\P8. CRANE LOAD CONSIDERED =XXX\P9. LAP LENGTH FOR     Fe 415    Fe 500D\P  1 COLUMNS         40 X DIA.  45 X D
  3
IA.\P  2 BEAMS AND SLABS  45 X DIA.  50 X DIA.\P10.NOMINAL COVER TO MAIN REINFORCEMENT TO MEET 2 HOURS PERIOD (MODERATE) OF FIRE RESISTANCE  FOUNDATION=50mm  RAFT=50mm  COLUMN=40mm RETAINING   WALL=30mm\P  LIFT PARDI=30mm   BEAM=30mm   SLAB=25 mm  \
  3
P11.IN CASE OF COLLINEAR BEAMS, BOTH TOP AND BOTTOM REINFORCEMENT AT A SUPPORT SHALL BE CONTINUED IN ADJACENT SPAN FOR FULL DEVELOPMENT LENGTH OR SPAN L/4 th  SPAN LENGTH OF ADJOINING  SPAN WHICHEVER IS MORE. \P12.IN CASE OF NONLINEAR BEAM AND IN CA
  3
SE THERE IS NO BEAM ON THE OTHER SIDE, BOTH TOP AND BOTTOM REINFORCEMENT AT A SUPPORT  SHALL BE ANCHORED IN THE SUPPORTING COLUMN FOR FULL DEVELOPMENT LENGTH.\P13.MINIMUM AND MAXIMUM DISTANCE BETWEEN INDIVIDUAL BARS SHALL BE AS PER CLAUSE NO 26.3 OF
  3
 IS:456 WITH LATEST AMENDMENTS. \P14.IN CASE DIAMETER AND NUMBER OF ADJACENT COLLINEAR BEAMS ARE SAME THEN BARS SHALL BE KEPT CONTINUOUS \P15.EXTRA STEEL AT TOP SUPPORT BETWEEN ADJACENT BEAMS IS SHOWN IN ANY ONE BEAM. THIS EXTRA STEEL IS TO BE CONTI
  3
NUED ON BOTH SIDES OF THE SUPPORT FOR REQUIRED ANCHORAGE LENGTH OR SPAN L/4 th SPAN LENGTH OF RESPECTIVE BEAMS \PWHICHEVER IS MORE. \P16.PROVIDE 2-#12 ELL BARS AT DISCONTINUOUS END OF BEAM\P17.BEAM/SLAB BOTTOM/TOP LEVEL TO BE KEPT AS INDICATED IN SC
  3
HEDULE/TABLE  \P18.DISINTERRING PERIOD SHALL NOT BE LESS THAN SPECIFIED \P  BELOW.\P  a) BEAMS  1. SPANNING UP TO 4.5m=14 DAYS\P           2. SPANNING UP TO 4.5m=21 DAYS\P  b) SLABS  1. SPANNING UP TO 4.5m=14 DAYS\P           2. SPANNING UP TO 4.5m=
  1
21 DAYS\P19.LEGENDS:\P  NGL- NATURAL GROUND LEVEL , TYP.- TYPICAL ,  \P C/C CENTER TO CENTER GB- GROUND BEAMS , PB= PLINTH BEAMS , FFL- FLOOR FINISH LEVEL , EQ.BHD- EQUAL BEHIND}
